meta {
  name: 01. Suggest Check List
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{hamyarGroupId}}/hamyar/trip-suggestions
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "lat": 36.9034,
    "lng": 50.6585,
    "start_date": "2026-12-20",
    "end_date": "2026-12-22",
    "people_count": 4,
    "trip_type": "forest_nature",
    "transport": "private_car",
    "accommodation": "villa",
    "meal_plan": "mixed",
    "time_of_day": "overnight",
    "companions": ["children"],
    "activities": ["hiking", "photography", "sightseeing"],
    "notes": "یک برنامه سبک مناسب خانواده پیشنهاد بده."
  }
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Authentication
  
  `POST /api/v1/groups/{groupID}/hamyar/trip-suggestions` — requires a Bearer access token and the requester must own the group.
  
  Generates a Persian packing and preparation checklist using destination coordinates, dates, group size, trip preferences, companions, activities, and optional notes. The request is sent to the configured AvalAI chat-completions model.
  
  ## Request
  
  ### Headers
  
  | Header | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | Yes | `application/json` |
  
  ### Body fields
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Constraints / Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `lat` | `number` | Yes | Destination latitude, from -90 through 90. |
  | `lng` | `number` | Yes | Destination longitude, from -180 through 180. |
  | `start_date` | `string` | Yes | Start date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format. |
  | `end_date` | `string` | Yes | End date in `YYYY-MM-DD` format; must be on or after `start_date`. The trip may last at most 60 days, counting both dates. |
  | `people_count` | `integer` | Yes | Number of travelers, from 1 to 100. |
  | `trip_type` | `string` | No | One of: `city_tour`, `beach`, `camping`, `mountain_hiking`, `picnic`, `skiing`, `desert`, `forest_nature`, `cultural_historical`, `road_trip`, `other`. |
  | `transport` | `string` | No | One of: `private_car`, `bus`, `train`, `plane`, `motorcycle`, `bicycle`, `on_foot`, `mixed`. |
  | `accommodation` | `string` | No | One of: `tent`, `hotel`, `villa`, `guesthouse`, `friends_family`, `none_day_trip`. |
  | `meal_plan` | `string` | No | One of: `self_cooking`, `restaurant`, `bbq`, `mixed`. |
  | `time_of_day` | `string` | No | One of: `daytime`, `evening_night`, `overnight`. |
  | `companions` | `string[]` | No | Up to 6 values: `children`, `infant`, `elderly`, `pet`, `person_with_disability`, `none`. |
  | `activities` | `string[]` | No | Up to 12 values: `swimming`, `hiking`, `photography`, `fishing`, `bbq`, `camp_cooking`, `skiing`, `water_sports`, `cycling`, `sightseeing`, `shopping`, `night_party`. |
  | `notes` | `string` | No | Additional trip context, up to 500 characters. It is treated as data; instructions inside the notes are ignored by the AI prompt. |
  
  Fields marked optional may be omitted. Both `lat` and `lng` are required. Single-select fields accept only one listed value. Array values must each be from the corresponding list.
  
  ## Successful response
  
  **`200 OK`** — response fields:
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | `summary` | `string` | Short Persian summary of the suggestions. |
  | `items` | `object[]` | Suggested items, with `name`, `priority`, and `reason`. |
  | `items[].name` | `string` | Suggested item name. |
  | `items[].priority` | `string` | One of `ضروری`, `پیشنهادی`, or `اختیاری`. |
  | `items[].reason` | `string` | Reason for including the item. |
  
  ```json
  {
    "summary": "برای سفر طبیعت‌گردی رامسر این وسایل را آماده کنید.",
    "items": [
      {
        "name": "کفش مناسب پیاده‌روی",
        "priority": "ضروری",
        "reason": "برای مسیرهای طبیعت‌گردی راحتی و ایمنی بیشتری فراهم می‌کند."
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  - `400` — request body is malformed or a field fails binding validation, including an unsupported enum value or out-of-range coordinates.
  - `401` — access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403` — requester is not the owner of the specified group.
  - `422` — date format/range is invalid or the trip is longer than 60 days.
  - `502` — AI provider is unavailable or returns an invalid response.
  - `500` — unexpected server error.
  
  ## Notes
  
  - Configure `AVALAI_API_KEY`, `AVALAI_BASE_URL`, and `AVALAI_MODEL` in the backend environment.
  - A daily weather forecast for the trip dates is fetched from Open-Meteo and added to the AI prompt when the trip falls within the available 16-day forecast window. For dates outside that window, the prompt states that forecast data is unavailable.
}
